message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Trust-Bounded Governance for LLM-Assisted SDN-IoT Defense: code and data"
abstract: "Code, installer, analysis scripts and run data for the manuscript 'Trust-Bounded Governance for LLM-Assisted SDN-IoT Defense: Formal Safety Guarantees in the Presence of Prompt Injection'. An untrusted advisor (rule-based, LLM or hybrid) proposes directives to an SDN controller; a deterministic verifier (V1-V10) admits them, and trusted IoT devices receive a metered, self-expiring fast path. The package reproduces 1,362 Mininet runs (1,351 valid) on os-ken, ONOS and POX."
